            "review_title": "Review at Hum's Pizza",
            "review_text": "Explore13790350970\n1 contribution\n0\nFresh, Tasty, and Worth a Try!\nApr 2025 • Couples\nI had a good experience at Hum’s Pizza! The Durian Chicago Pizza was surprisingly delicious, creamy, and full of flavor. I also loved the Italian Beef Pizza! It was savory, fresh vegetables and perfectly baked. I also tried the Pesto Seafood Pasta, the pasta was perfectly cooked! Highly recommended for pizza lovers in VietNam!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 17, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
