            "review_title": "Review at Hum's Pizza",
            "review_text": "Travel11527711737\n1 contribution\n0\nExperience the service at Pizza Hum's\nMay 2025 • Friends\nFirst, the food is delicious, I tried both Italian pizza and Chicago pizza. In my opinion, I like Italian pizza better. Carbonara and Shrimp Bisque are not bad suggestions for those who like fatty food. Overall, the food is quite delicious.\n\nSecond, the air here is also fresh and clean. On the ground floor I could watch the chefs making pizza, if you like privacy, the first floor is a good choice.\n\nFinally, I was taken care of very enthusiastically by the staff here, they always asked me if I needed anything else.\n\nI found Hum's Pizza to be a worthwhile experience. I will be back again.\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
