            "review_text": "Seraphina C\n6 contributions\n0\nThe best pizza house at Thu dau mot!\nApr 2025 • Solo\nVery nice and delicious food. The Chicago pizza cheese is excellent. Soup, salad and all main dishes are great. The service people are all kind and good English speakers. The restaurant decorations also clean and comfort, suitable for single, friends n families to come. Have to try !!! The best pizza place in Thu Dau Mot city.\n\n非常讚跟好吃的食物。芝加哥披薩🍕有非常棒的起士。湯、沙拉跟主菜都很好吃。餐廳裝潢很乾淨舒適。服務人員英文都很好。適合個人、朋友或家庭用餐。一定要試試。是土龍木最好的披薩餐廳。\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
